                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/576: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Erwin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-09-09T11:00:00-04:00">September 9, 1937—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. Your no. 60, September 8, 5 p.m. Department leaves to your discretion
                    procedure to be followed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
